{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09971","headline":"僧舍小池 · 张鼎","name":"僧舍小池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"引出白云根，潺潺涨藓痕。\n冷光摇砌锡，疎影露枝猿。\n净带凋霜叶，香通洗药源。\n贝多文字古，宜向此中翻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}